                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "source_figure": "S3.F2",
            "heading": "Figure 2",
            "source_image_paths": [
              "2605.06667v1/pipeline.png"
            ],
            "source_caption": "Figure 2. ActCam pipeline. Given a reference image, an acting video, and a target camera trajectory, we (1) estimate background depth from an inpainted reference, (2) recover motion and align it to the background scene via fitting, and (3) rasterize pose and depth+pose control signals under the target viewpoint. A two-phase denoising schedule conditions early steps on\ndepth+pose for stronger camera control, then refines with pose-only to encourage motion adherence.",
            "assigned_assets": [
              {
                "path": "/home/dictation/paper-fetch-skill/.paper-fetch-runs/official-reacquisition-2026-09-19/papers/2605.06667v1_assets/ablation_nd.png",
