                "caption": "Figure 2. ActCam pipeline. Given a reference image, an acting video, and a target camera trajectory, we (1) estimate background depth from an inpainted reference, (2) recover motion and align it to the background scene via fitting, and (3) rasterize pose and depth+pose control signals under the target viewpoint. A two-phase denoising schedule conditions early steps on depth+pose for stronger camera control, then refines with pose-only to encourage motion adherence.",
